  "definition": "Use, Maintenance, and Removal of a Portable Toilet",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-04-27",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
